          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer text-navy-800 font-medium hover:bg-slate-50 list-none">
            Does the affidavit need notarization?
            <span class="text-slate-400 ml-4 shrink-0 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▾</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes. It is a sworn affidavit and should be executed before a notary in accordance with the statutory form and recording requirements.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden group">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer text-navy-800 font-medium hover:bg-slate-50 list-none">
            Must I send the owner a copy?
            <span class="text-slate-400 ml-4 shrink-0 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▾</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">Generally yes, within 30 days after filing. Preserve evidence of service and follow the statutory alternative if ordinary service cannot be completed.</div>
        </details>
